        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Blake LeVine, Brad Pitt, Princess Diana, Mother Teresa, Frank Sinatra, Maury Povich, Jon Stewart\n- Media Organizations: Entertainment Tonight, CNN, The New York Post, Premiere Magazine, The Los Angeles Times, radio programs\n- Topics: celebrity autographs, childhood media appearances\n\nFacts:\n- Brad Pitt was born on December 18, 1963.\n- William Bradley Pitt is an American actor and producer.\n- As a child, Blake LeVine was featured on Entertainment Tonight, Maury Povich, The Jon Stewart Show, CNN, The New York Post, Premiere Magazine, The Los Angeles Times, and numerous radio programs.\n- Blake LeVine’s childhood media appearances were about his experiences collecting autographs from celebrities.\n- Blake LeVine collected autographs from Princess Diana, Mother Teresa, Brad Pitt, Frank Sinatra, and more than 1,000 notable people.",
